<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Summary">Summary</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=File:World-Trade-Center_9-11.jpg&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Summary"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<div class="hproduct commons-file-information-table">
<table class="fileinfotpl-type-information vevent" dir="ltr">

<tbody><tr>
<td id="fileinfotpl&#95;desc" class="fileinfo-paramfield" lang="en">Description<span class="summary fn" style="display:none">World-Trade-Center 9-11.jpg</span></td>
<td class="description">
<div class="description en" dir="ltr" lang="en"><span class="language en" title="English"><b>English&#58; </b></span> The north tower (1 WTC) of the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Trade_Center" class="extiw" title="en:World Trade Center">World Trade Center</a> after the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/September_11_attacks" class="extiw" title="en:September 11 attacks">September 11 attacks</a> in <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York_City" class="extiw" title="en:New York City">New York</a>, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York" class="extiw" title="en:New York">New York</a>, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States" class="extiw" title="en:United States">United States</a>. By this time, the south tower (2 WTC) had already collapsed.</div>
<div class="description eo" dir="ltr" lang="eo"><span class="language eo" title="Esperanto"><b>Esperanto&#58; </b></span> La norda turo ("1 WTC") de <a href="https://eo.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Trade_Center" class="extiw" title="eo:World Trade Center"><div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="description en" style="display:inline;">World Trade Center</div></a> en <a href="https://eo.wikipedia.org/wiki/Novjorko" class="extiw" title="eo:Novjorko">Novjorko</a> (<a href="https://eo.wikipedia.org/wiki/Novjorkio" class="extiw" title="eo:Novjorkio">Novjorkio</a>, <a href="https://eo.wikipedia.org/wiki/Usono" class="extiw" title="eo:Usono">Usono</a>), post la teroristaj atakoj <a href="https://eo.wikipedia.org/wiki/11-a_de_septembro_2001" class="extiw" title="eo:11-a de septembro 2001">la 11-an de septembro 2001</a>. La suda turo ("2 WTC") tiam jam detruiĝis.</div>
<div class="description ru" dir="ltr" lang="ru"><span class="language ru" title="Russian"><b>Русский&#58; </b></span> <a href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%82_11_%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%8F%D0%B1%D1%80%D1%8F_2001" class="extiw" title="ru:Террористический акт 11 сентября 2001">Теракт 11 сентября 2001</a> в Нью-Йорке: <a href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%92%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80" class="extiw" title="ru:Всемирный торговый центр">Всемирный торговый центр (ВТЦ)</a>.</div>
