<tbody><tr>
<td style="padding:5px"><div class="wpImageAnnotatorControl wpImageAnnotatorOff"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Applications-graphics.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Applications-graphics.svg/60px-Applications-graphics.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="45" height="45" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Applications-graphics.svg/120px-Applications-graphics.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" /></a></span></div>
</td>
<td style="width:100%">This  is a <i><b><span lang="en" dir="ltr"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Image_editing" class="extiw" title="en:Image editing"><span lang="en" dir="ltr">retouched picture</span></a></span></b></i>, which means that it has been digitally altered from its original version. Modifications: <i>removed "blue tint" of photo (taken through window pane?) for truer color</i>. The&#160;original can be viewed here: <b><a href="/wiki/File:WTC9-11.jpg" title="File:WTC9-11.jpg">WTC9-11.jpg</a>&#58;&#160;<span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:WTC9-11.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/WTC9-11.jpg/40px-WTC9-11.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="16" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/WTC9-11.jpg/60px-WTC9-11.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="970" data-file-height="656" /></a></span></b>. Modifications made by <a href="/wiki/User:Ben_Lunsford" title="User:Ben Lunsford">Ben Lunsford</a>.
<p><span class="layouttemplateargs" style="display:none;speak:none;" title="template=Retouched+picture 1%3Dremoved+%22blue+tint%22+of+photo+%28taken+through+window+pane%3F%29+for+truer+color 2%3DWTC9-11.jpg 3%3DBen+Lunsford 4%3D 5%3D">&#160;</span>
</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
